<title>USA: Sealed Air's McCandless to retire as CFO.</title>
<headline>Sealed Air's McCandless to retire as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SADDLE BROOK, N.J. 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sealed Air Corp said on Friday that Warren McCandless, the company's senior vice president-finance and chief financial officer, has decided to retire at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>Horst Tebbe, vice president-international and former chief information officer, will succeed McCandless January 1, 1997.</p>
